;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;"ENCOUNTER"系イベント（エクストラ構文）
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_G3
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;経験の変更は齟齬が出る場合がありますので、CSVを修正し同梱する事を推奨します


FONTITALIC
PRINTFORMDL This character does not have character-specific dialogue.
PRINTFORMDL Generic dialog is being used instead (%PERSONALITY_TYPE(TARGET)%).
PRINTFORMDL Please understand that this dialogue may not fit the character.
FONTREGULAR
PRINTW
PRINTFORML 「Hey. I haven't seen you here before.」
PRINTFORMDW The %PRINT_MALE("boy",TARGET)% says as %HE_SHE(TARGET)% approaches you.
PRINTFORMW 「It's a pleasure being able to meet you.」
PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TARGET,1)% says as %HE_SHE(TARGET)% extends %HIS_HER(TARGET)% hand for a handshake.
PRINTFORMDW You return %HIS_HER(TARGET)% gesture, taking %HIS_HER(TARGET)% hand in yours.
PRINTFORMW 「My name is %NameChecker(TARGET,1)%. What's yours?」
PRINTFORMDW You tell %HIM_HER(TARGET)% your name.
PRINTFORMW 「...Hmmmm, %CALLNAME:MASTER%...is it? I see.」
PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% falls silent for a moment.
PRINTL
PRINTFORMW 「We should get going, or maybe, we could talk for a bit more.」
PRINTFORMW 「『Break the ice』 as they would say.」
PRINTL
PRINTFORMDW Indeed, you do talk to %CALLNAME:TARGET% for a bit, getting to know %HIM_HER(TARGET)% bit by bit.
RETURN 1

;@G3_BEFORETRAIN
;一日の開始時、正確には来訪判定時に読み込む関数,使うときはコメントアウトを外すこと
;ここでCFLAG:XX:翌日来訪を設定して確実に来訪させたりTCVAR:XX:発情で朝っぱらからサカらせることもできる
;ただし「毎朝例外なく読み込まれる」ため、条件を設定しておくことが望ましい


;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;"SP_EVENT" events
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;==================================================
;First kiss on the way home from a date
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_G3_1(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;地の文表示
CALL SPEVENT_MESSAGE_1(ARG,ARG:1)
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	;キスをキャンセルしたい場合は以下を開放
	;TCVAR:キスキャンセル = 1
    PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG(@"As %PARSE("you")% and %CALLNAME:TARGET% walk home from %PARSE("your")% date, %HE_SHE(TARGET)% looks like %HE_SHE(TARGET)% has something on %HIS_HER(TARGET)% mind...")%
    PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG(@"%HE_SHE(TARGET, 1)% keeps looking around and stealing glances at %PARSE("you")% when %HE_SHE(TARGET)% thinks %PARSE("you")% aren't looking.")%
    PRINTFORMDW Just when %PARSE("you're")% about to ask %HIM_HER(TARGET)% if something's wrong, it happens.
    PRINTFORMDW %BREAKENG(@"One moment %PARSE("you're")% walking along next to %HIM_HER(TARGET)%, and the next %HE_SHE(TARGET)%'s grabbed %PARSE("your")% head and pulled %PARSE("you")% into a kiss.")%
	PRINTFORMDW The two of %PARSE("you")% stay like that for quite a while before %HE_SHE(TARGET)% finally breaks the kiss.
	PRINTFORMW 「I hope I wasn't too forward. I just wanted to thank you for such a wonderful date.」
	PRINTFORMW 「And I wanted to thank you in general. You've been so kind to me, and so patient, even after how I've treated you...」
	PRINTFORMW 「I'm sure it wasn't a very good kiss. I've...」
	PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s blush deepens a little.
	PRINTFORMW 「I've never actually kissed anyone before. But I like you, and I wanted to give my first kiss to you.」
	IF CFLAG:TARGET:処女喪失相手 == MASTER
		PRINTFORMW 「I've already given you my virginity, after all.」
	ELSEIF CFLAG:TARGET:既成事実 & 合意_うふふ
		PRINTFORMW 「I've already given you my body, after all.」
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1

;==================================================
;Confessing on the way home from a date
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_G3_2(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;地の文表示
CALL SPEVENT_MESSAGE_2(ARG,ARG:1)
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;小分岐
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;Confession
	;After this dialogue is displayed, the player will have a choice to become the character's lover or turn them down.	
	;告白内容
	;この告白内容表示後に受けるかどうかの選択分が表示されます
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 0
		PRINTFORMDW As you and %CALLNAME:TARGET% walk home from your date, %HE_SHE(TARGET)% looks like %HE_SHE(TARGET)% has something on %HIS_HER(TARGET)% mind...
        PRINTFORMW
        PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%...」
		PRINTFORMW 「I hope this isn't going to make things too awkward between us, but...」
		PRINTFORMW 「I think... I think I'm in love with you.」
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TARGET,1)% looks away from you for a moment, but forces %HIM_HER(TARGET)% gaze back to you.
        PRINTFORMW 「Do you love me, too?」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白オッケー（恋人が付く）
	;Confession accepted (player and character become lovers)	
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
        PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% stares at you, eyes wide.
        PRINTFORMDW Then %HE_SHE(TARGET)% smiles. A real, warm, genuine smile, not like the fake smiles %HES_SHES(TARGET)% made before.
        PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TARGET)% wraps %HIS_HER(TARGET)% arms around you and hugs you tightly.
        PRINTFORMDW You smile and return %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s hug, stroking %HIS_HER(TARGET)% back.
        PRINTFORMDW The two of you stay like that for a long time, wrapped in each others' arms...
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白失敗
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
        PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% stares at you for a while without speaking.
        PRINTFORMDW A sense of anger reaches out into 
        PRINTFORMW 「Do you THINK that was a good idea?」
		PRINTFORMW 「To reject someone's connfession, one's moment of expression?」
		PRINTFORMW 「All because of what, you probably already have a "lover"?」
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMW 「Whatever.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I'll not go and witchhunt whoever you sleep with, but fine.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Go out, find someone else who you like more than me.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Do it, I won't stop you.」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF

ENDIF
RETURN 1

;==================================================
;デート帰り
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_G3_3(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;地の文表示
CALL SPEVENT_MESSAGE_3(ARG,ARG:1)
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;小分岐
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;通常帰宅
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「Hm... that was quite enjoyable.」
		PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% beams at %PARSE("you")% and squeezes %PARSE("your")% hand.
		PRINTFORMW 「I wouldn't mind doing that again.」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;Hate Mark 1 removed
	;反発刻印消去イベント
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		PRINTFORMW 「Okay, Fine.」
		PRINTFORMW 「You redeemed yourself.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Let's just walk away like nothing has ever happened between the two of us.」
		PRINTFORML
		PRINTFORMW 「Capeesh?」
		PRINTFORMDW Capeesh.
		PRINTFORMDW As you and %CALLNAME:TARGET% begin to walk away, you feel a sense of weight has been freed from you. 
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;反発刻印2>1レベルダウンイベント
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		PRINTFORMW 「It seems that you can behave yourself after all.」
		PRINTFORMW 「But just to be clear: if you're doing this to try and sleep with me\@ CFLAG:TARGET:既成事実 & 合意_うふふ ? again #\@, it's not going to work.」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;反発刻印3>2レベルダウンイベント
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 3
		PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% continues to glare at you, the same way %HE_SHE(TARGET)%'s been glaring this whole time.
		PRINTFORMDW %PARSE("You think")% %HIS_HER(TARGET)% glare might be a little less hateful, though...
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORML
ENDIF
RETURN 1

;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;"EVENT"系イベント
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;==================================================
;部屋で遭遇
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EVENT_G3_1(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The player enters a room the character's in	
	;小分岐
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;MASTERが入ってきた
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		$DailyLines
		SELECTCASE RAND:3
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORML 「Ah, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
				PRINTFORML 「Is everything all right? You seem unhappy.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Would you like to talk about it?」
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORML 「Ah, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
				PRINTFORML 「You seem to be in a good mood.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Did something nice happen? I'd like to hear about it.」
			CASE 2
				PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% turns to look at %PARSE("you")% as %PARSE("you enter")% the room.
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(TARGET, 1)% greets %PARSE("you")% with %HIS_HER(TARGET)% usual smile.		
		ENDSELECT
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character enters a room the player's in	
	;TARGETが入ってきた
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		SELECTCASE RAND:3
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORMW 「Ah, %CALLNAME:MASTER%! I was wondering where you were.」
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%! I was looking for you.」
			CASE 2
				PRINTFORMW 「I hope I'm not interrupting anything important.」
				PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% smiles nervously at you.
		ENDSELECT
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character enters a room the player's bathing in and joins them in the bath	
	;TARGETが風呂に入ってきて一緒に入る
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 3
		SELECTCASE RAND:3
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORMW 「Ah, %CALLNAME:MASTER%! Looks like you're having a bath as well.」
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%! Sorry for the little predicament, but it seems like we're bathing together now.」
			CASE 2
				PRINTFORMW 「I'm gonna go in the bath with you, okay %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」
				PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% smiles nervously at you, before getting into the bath.
		ENDSELECT
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character enters a room the player's bathing in and leaves	
	;TARGETが風呂に入ってきて出て行った
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 4
		SELECTCASE RAND:3
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORMW 「Ah, %CALLNAME:MASTER%! Sorry about that!」
				PRINTFORMW 「I didn't expect you to be bathing...」
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORMW 「Ah! M-my apologies!」
				PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% opens the door a crack, sees %PARSE("you're")% bathing in there, and quickly slams it shut.
			CASE 2
				PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% opens the bathroom door...
				PRINTL
				PRINTL
				PRINTL
				PRINTL
				PRINTFORMW 「!!!」
				PRINTFORMDW And finds you in it.
				PRINTFORMW 「Look, I'm sorry, I'll leave right now.」
				PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% goes beet read at you, before leaving the room.
		ENDSELECT
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character enters a room the player's bathing in and kicks them out of the bath	
	;TARGETが風呂に入ってきて追い出された
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 5
		PRINTFORML 「Can you leave the bath please?」
		PRINTFORML 「You're hogging the bath all for yourself, and wasting all of the water.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I really need to take a bath, and I can't really do that with you in the way.」
		PRINTFORMDW You get out of the bathroom and let %CALLNAME:TARGET% do %HIS_HER(TARGET)% thing.
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;Encountering the player while they're outside	
	;外出先で遭遇した
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 6
		GOTO DailyLines
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;Encountering the player while they're on a date with another character
	;ARG:1 is the person the player's on a date with (if you want to have custom dialogue
	;for dating a specific character in front of this character, etc)	
	;他キャラとデート中に遭遇した
	;ARG:1にデート相手
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 7
		PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% smirks at you. 
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;First greeting of the day on the player's MAIN_MAP (the part of the world map they're living in: ex. The Forest of Magic, the Underworld, the Hakurei Shrine, etc.)
	;Note: after this dialogue is displayed, it will immediately be followed up by the ARG == 1 (the player enters a room the character's in)
	;or ARG == 2 dialogue (the character enters a room the player's in)
	;I think this only displays if the character walked in on you having sex the previous day?	
	;MAIN_MAP上で一日最初の挨拶
	;注、このあと通常の遭遇口上、ARG==1 OR ARG==2に接続します
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 0
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 8
		PRINTFORML 
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;First greeting of the day when the player is not on their MAIN_MAP
	;ARG:1 is the person the player's on a date with. If it's 0, they're not on a date.
	;Note: after this dialogue is displayed, it will immediately be followed up by the ARG == 6 (encountering the player while they're outside)
	;or ARG == 7 dialogue (encountering the player while they're on a date with another character)	
	;外出先で一日最初の挨拶
	;ARG:1にデート相手、ARG:1が0の場合は非デート
	;注、このあと通常の外出先で遭遇した口上、ARG==6 OR ARG==7に接続します
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 9
		;ARG:1とデート中
		IF ARG:1
		;一人で外出
		ELSE
		SELECTCASE RAND:3
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%! I was just thinking about coming to your house to visit you, and now here you are!」
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORMW 「Ah, I was hoping you'd come and visit.」
			CASE 2
				PRINTFORML 「You came all \@ CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 / 100 == 9 ? the way down here # this way\@ just to see me? That means a lot to me...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Thank you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
		ENDSELECT		
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1

;==================================================
;When the player wakes up in the morning (good morning dialogue)
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EVENT_G3_2(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------

IF LOCAL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;小分岐
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character woke up first, and they aren't living with the player	
	;非同棲かつ相手が先に起きてる
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;The player is in the character's room
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1 && !ARG:1
			$GoodMorning
			PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:TARGET% smiles at %PARSE("you")% as %PARSE("you")% open %PARSE("your")% eyes.
			PRINTFORMW 「Good morning, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. Did you sleep well?」
			RETURN 1
		ENDIF
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;The character is in the player's room
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1 && ARG:1 == 1
			GOTO GoodMorning
			RETURN 1
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character woke up first, and they are living with the player	
	;同棲かつ相手が起きている
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 0
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		GOTO GoodMorning 
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The player woke up first, and they are living with the character
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 3
		PRINTFORMW 「%FSYN("lips_muffle")%...」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
